   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening local grassroot capacity on peace, human rights and gender issues</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds the social programme of a Catholic diocese in one of the areas of Colombia most affected by the conflict, a traditional stronghold of the FARC guerrillas. The new 2014-2016 strategy of the dioceses will continues to develop the capacity of the parish groups (EPPAS) established in the previous strategic plan focussing on local advocacy initiatives, developing local action plans to support vulnerable groups in the parish (IDPs, children, old people and women) and / or protect the environment, and strengthen the rights of women. The Church is one of the few civilian agencies institutions working in this region, and CAFOD currently one of very few development agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
